              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword. May ride a horse at no cost, or a Warhorse (+8 pts). Light armour +2, shield +2 or large shield +3 (on foot only). Friendly units within 12" may use his Leadership. Warhorse profile: M8 WS3 BS0 S3 T- W- I3 A1 Ld-. (rulebook p.174)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
