  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="407e-01b4-29a3-5bb7" name="Roman Army List - List Notes" publicationId="556c-7119-7234-b625" hidden="false">
      <description>ROMAN ARMY LIST (WAB 2nd Edition, pp.172-181)
Characters up to 1/4 of points; Legionaries at least 1/4; Auxiliaries up to 3/4; Special Units up to 1/4.
Units must have at least 5 models; no maximum. One model per unit may be a standard bearer (+5), musician (+5) or leader (+5; Legionary Centurion +10).
No more special units than legionary and auxiliary units combined.
Roman characters may lead allied Barbarian units (not vice versa). Allies come from the Barbarian list (not enforced here).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
